    \section1 About

    With \QP you can record and analyze performance problems in QML applications,
    CPU and memory usage of an application on the desktop and embedded devices,
    and Visualize Chrome trace events generated in Chrome Trace Format (CTF).

    \QP is integrated into \QC and \QVSC.

    \b {HOW TO}

